  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Am&#xE9;lioration de la s&#xE9;curit&#xE9; alimentaire gr&#xE2;ce &#xE0; des interventions agricoles d&#x2019;urgence dans les communes flagship et vuln&#xE9;rables de Diffa, Tahoua et Tillab&#xE9;ri</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this FAO project is to improve food security for vulnerable households through emergency agricultural interventions in the flagship communes of Tillab&#xE9;ri and Diffa, and the communes of Tillia in Tahoua and T&#xE9;ra in Tillab&#xE9;ri. The project provides support to vulnerable farmers and fishing households in the form of unconditional cash transfer, agricultural inputs, livestock feed, veterinary care support, fishing kits and fish processing equipment. The project also aims at strengthening the accountability and capacity for national humanitarian staff. The intervention provides humanitarian assistance to 56,700 people (12,338 men, 12,483 women and 31,879 children) including 2,835 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
